<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program by our boss, Torey Malatia, who reminds you every pledge drive--
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ 对我们节目的管理监督由我们的老板 Torey Malatia 负责，他在每次认捐活动时提醒你——

00:58:44.740 --> 00:58:49.610
<v Arthur Phillips>"Don't forget me, please. You are so good. And I so much need something good."
<v Arthur Phillips>“别忘了我，求你了。你人真好。我太需要一点美好的东西了。”

00:58:49.610 --> 00:58:54.620
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是 Ira Glass。下周回来，带来更多《美国生活》的故事。

